/*--------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  NF270 INTRINSIC REJECTION OF Na2SO4 AGAINST THE PERMEATE FLUX -- a dataset
  a membrane fit reads (fitParameters, residual kind membrane).

  Fernandez de Labastida & Yaroshchuk, Membranes 11 (2021) 272,
  doi:10.3390/membranes11040272 (CC BY 4.0), Figure 3a: the measured
  symbols, Na2SO4 0.01 mol/L, 20 C, flat NF270 in a rotating-disk cell, CP-
  corrected by the authors.  Digitised by bin/curate/digitise_fdl2021.py;
  written in this grammar by bin/curate/export_fdl2021_rejections.py
  (R = 1 - 1/f, Jv = J_v[um/s] x 1e-6).

  READING ERROR (not a measurement uncertainty -- none is published):
    J_v   6.431 um/s +- 0.06   f 52.2045 +- 0.6567
    J_v  10.469 um/s +- 0.06   f 77.1576 +- 0.6567
    J_v  18.903 um/s +- 0.06   f 122.7955 +- 0.6567
    J_v  27.248 um/s +- 0.06   f 160.2251 +- 0.6567
    J_v  33.619 um/s +- 0.06   f 214.728 +- 0.6567
    J_v  41.755 um/s +- 0.06   f 261.6792 +- 0.6567
    J_v  49.472 um/s +- 0.06   f 284.9906 +- 0.6567

  NOT IN THE FEED BELOW: the 2e-4 mol/L NaNO3 + NH4Cl traces the authors
  added (2 % of the dominant salt).  The role this dataset plays -- fit or
  held out -- is declared by the operation that reads it, never here.
\*--------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

property     membrane.rejection;
membrane     NF270;

provenance
{
    source       measured;
    reviewStatus digitisedFromFigure;
    citation     "M. Fernandez de Labastida, A. Yaroshchuk, Nanofiltration of Multi-Ion Solutions: Quantitative Control of Concentration Polarization and Interpretation by Solution-Diffusion-Electro-Migration Model, Membranes 11 (2021) 272, Figure 3a";
    identity     "one series of the study cited above; no doi identity: the four fdl2021_* datasets are four salts of ONE study, and a held-out one is held out WITHIN that study, not an independent study";
    licence      CC-BY-4.0;
}

T            293.15 K;
feed         { Na2SO4 10 mol/m3; }

columns
(
    { name Jv;  unit m/s; }
    { name R_Na2SO4;  unit -; }
);

data
(
    6.431000e-06  0.980845
    1.046900e-05  0.987040
    1.890300e-05  0.991856
    2.724800e-05  0.993759
    3.361900e-05  0.995343
    4.175500e-05  0.996179
    4.947200e-05  0.996491
);
